{"id":"A1-L034","title":"Have / have got: production and review","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U02","focus":"Have / have got — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Have / have got — produção e revisão","pron":"I am × I’m","verbs":["leave"],"pv":[],"expr":["I’m not a fan of…"],"words":["fan","gold","teapot","mug","kettle","toaster","sink","saucer","jug","ladle","grater","tongs","colander","peeler"],"field":"Rotina","genre":"Poema, haiku ou letra","skill":"Escuta","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 34 · Have / have got: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Have / have got — produção e revisão.","**Verbos:** leave.","**Expressões:** I’m not a fan of….","**Pronúncia:** I am × I’m.","**8 palavras novas** (rotina).","**Texto do dia:** poema, haiku ou letra."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo escrever um poema curto com have e dizer que não sou fã de algo."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["fan","fã"],["gold","ouro"],["teapot","teapot"],["mug","mug"],["kettle","kettle"],["toaster","toaster"],["sink","sink"],["saucer","saucer"],["jug","jug"],["ladle","ladle"],["grater","grater"],["tongs","tongs"],["colander","colander"],["peeler","peeler"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A song lyric","blocks":[{"type":"poem","title":"What I’ve Got","lines":["I’ve got a cup, I’ve got a spoon,","I’ve got a window and the moon.","I haven’t got a lot of gold,","but I’ve got friends, so I’m not cold."],"by":"Original lyric for learners","gloss":[["spoon","colher"],["moon","lua"],["gold","ouro"],["cold","frio"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The singer has got a cup.","ans":"T","why":"“I’ve got a cup.”"},{"q":"The singer has got a lot of gold.","ans":"F","why":"“haven’t got a lot of gold.”"},{"q":"The singer has friends.","ans":"T","why":"“I’ve got friends.”"},{"q":"The singer is a woman.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“spoon” means…","opts":["colher","garfo","faca"],"ans":0,"why":"spoon = colher."},{"q":"“moon” means…","opts":["lua","sol","estrela"],"ans":0,"why":"moon = lua."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Have / have got: review","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Forma","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Afirmativa","**I’ve got a cup.**"],["Negativa","**I haven’t got gold.**"],["Pergunta","**Have you got friends?**"]],"cap":"Resumo"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Gostar / não gostar","body":"**I’m a fan of…** (sou fã de) · **I’m not a fan of…** (não sou fã de): *I’m not a fan of coffee.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ got a cup.","a":"’ve","why":"I → ’ve."},{"s":"She ___ got gold. (not)","a":"hasn’t","why":"she → hasn’t."},{"s":"I’m not a ___ of coffee. (fan)","a":"fan","why":"fan of.","say":"I’m not a fan of coffee"},{"s":"___ you got friends?","a":"Have","why":"you → Have."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["spoon","colher"],["fork","garfo"],["knife","faca"],["plate","prato"],["cup","xícara"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["eight","Yes","at"],"ans":"Yes at eight","pt":"Sim, às oito."},{"words":["got","two","Yes","I've"],"ans":"Yes I've got two","pt":"Sim, tenho dois."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"fan","pos":"noun","pt":"fã","ex":"I’m a fan.","expt":"Sou fã."},{"w":"gold","pos":"noun","pt":"ouro","ex":"Gold is yellow.","expt":"Ouro é amarelo."},{"w":"teapot","pos":"word","pt":"teapot","ex":"bule","expt":"A small teapot."},{"w":"mug","pos":"word","pt":"mug","ex":"caneca","expt":"A big mug."},{"w":"kettle","pos":"word","pt":"kettle","ex":"chaleira","expt":"The kettle is hot."},{"w":"toaster","pos":"word","pt":"toaster","ex":"torradeira","expt":"A new toaster."},{"w":"sink","pos":"word","pt":"sink","ex":"pia","expt":"A deep sink."},{"w":"saucer","pos":"word","pt":"saucer","ex":"pires","expt":"A cup and saucer."},{"w":"jug","pos":"word","pt":"jug","ex":"jarra","expt":"A jug of water."},{"w":"ladle","pos":"word","pt":"ladle","ex":"concha","expt":"Use a ladle."},{"w":"grater","pos":"word","pt":"grater","ex":"ralador","expt":"A cheese grater."},{"w":"tongs","pos":"word","pt":"tongs","ex":"pinça","expt":"Use tongs."},{"w":"colander","pos":"word","pt":"colander","ex":"escorredor","expt":"Drain in a colander."},{"w":"peeler","pos":"word","pt":"peeler","ex":"descascador","expt":"A sharp peeler."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I’m not a fan of…** — Não sou fã de…","**Have you got a fork?** — Você tem um garfo?","**Yes, I’ve got two.** — Sim, tenho dois.","**I’m not a fan of cold soup.** — Não sou fã de sopa fria.","**I’ve got it.** — Já tenho.","**Me neither.** — Eu também não.","**Lucky you!** — Que sorte!"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"leave","pt":"sair, deixar","forms":[["I leave","I leave at eight."],["you leave","You leave the key."],["he / she / it leaves","She leaves home early."],["we / they leave","We leave together."]],"note":"**leave** = sair de um lugar ou deixar algo."}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Table talk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Table talk","lines":[["Ana","Have you got a fork?","Você tem um garfo?"],["Leo","Yes, I’ve got two.","Sim, tenho dois."],["Ana","I’m not a fan of cold soup.","Não sou fã de sopa fria."],["Leo","Me neither.","Eu também não."],["Ana","Do you leave early?","Você sai cedo?"],["Leo","Yes, at eight.","Sim, às oito."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: I am × I’m","items":[{"label":"I am × I’m","note":"“I am” × “I’m”: na fala usamos a contração. Treine: I’m a fan, I’m not a fan.","words":["I’m a fan","I’m not a fan","I’m tired"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you have got on your table.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I’ve got a cup and a plate."},{"q":"Say what you are not a fan of.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I’m not a fan of cold soup."},{"q":"Say when you leave home.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I leave at eight."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 4-line lyric with I’ve got.","model":"I’ve got a cup. / I’ve got a book. / I haven’t got a lot of time, / but I’ve got you.","checklist":["Usei **I’ve got**","Usei **haven’t got**","4 linhas"],"words":"4 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “spoon” mean?","opts":["colher","garfo","prato"],"ans":0,"why":"**spoon** = colher."},{"q":"What does “fork” mean?","opts":["faca","garfo","xícara"],"ans":1,"why":"**fork** = garfo."},{"q":"What does “knife” mean?","opts":["prato","fã","faca"],"ans":2,"why":"**knife** = faca."},{"q":"What does “plate” mean?","opts":["prato","xícara","ouro"],"ans":0,"why":"**plate** = prato."},{"q":"“I’m not a fan of…” means…","opts":["Não sou fã de…","Sou fã de…","Preciso de…"],"ans":0,"why":"not a fan of = não ser fã."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Em **Reading**, letras de música treinam vocabulário e ritmo.","Em **Speaking**, *I’m not a fan of…* é educado para discordar."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Cante uma **música simples** e destaque *have got*.","Mostre **polidez** com *not a fan of*.","Erro típico: *“I no like.”* → *I’m not a fan of…*"]}]}]}